WEBVTT

02:26.720 --> 02:29.260
<b>Thunderbolt, Wild Dance!</b>

02:43.120 --> 02:45.310
<b>Spry guy's got some moves!</b>

03:16.220 --> 03:17.590
<b>Don't worry about me!</b>

03:17.590 --> 03:19.060
<b>Hurry and use some other magic!</b>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.030
<b><i>Are you gambling your life
to buy me time?</i></b>

03:24.150 --> 03:25.470
<b>Mystical Snake Armor!</b>

03:33.270 --> 03:34.360
<b>Shield Shadow!</b>

03:56.520 --> 03:57.930
<b>Dimensional Summon!</b>

04:11.430 --> 04:14.850
<b>Why does her Dimensional Summon 
look different than mine?</b>

04:15.760 --> 04:17.470
<b>Night Stalker Knight, attack!</b>

04:44.970 --> 04:46.320
<b>Hurry and make adjustments.</b>

04:46.320 --> 04:49.100
<b>My cultivation level isn't high enough,
 so its summon duration is limited!</b>

04:49.620 --> 04:51.880
<b>You've already bought me enough time.</b>

04:51.880 --> 04:53.350
<b>Leave the rest to me!</b>

04:57.020 --> 04:59.150
<b>Thunderbolt, Wild Dance!</b>

05:03.770 --> 05:05.770
<b>It's still not dead?</b>

05:05.770 --> 05:06.870
<b>Then take one more!</b>

05:17.020 --> 05:18.500
<b>The undead keep coming!</b>

05:18.500 --> 05:20.100
<b>We can't hold them off!</b>

05:20.740 --> 05:23.810
<b>No. There's not enough time to draw 
a mid-tier magic constellation.</b>

05:25.900 --> 05:27.060
<b>We'll have to use a low-tier one!</b>

05:28.400 --> 05:29.600
<b>Lightning Seal, Electric Field!</b>

05:48.970 --> 05:50.680
<b>I'm losing control of the situation here!</b>

05:55.650 --> 05:56.770
<b>What did I say?</b>

05:56.770 --> 05:58.080
<b>I told you guys to run!</b>

05:58.080 --> 06:00.560
<b>Now we're all stuck here!</b>

06:09.350 --> 06:12.890
<b>Why did you all abandon me? Why?</b>

06:12.890 --> 06:15.600
<b>Shi Shaoju, Wang Tong, Zhang Xiaohou...!</b>

06:16.410 --> 06:17.470
<b>Zhang Xiaohou?!</b>

06:18.680 --> 06:21.030
<b>You guys were supposed to stay with me!</b>

06:21.030 --> 06:23.310
<b>Aren't we supposed to be a team?!</b>

06:26.310 --> 06:29.720
<b><i>Could it be that he was Xiaohou's 
teammate while he was alive?</i></b>

06:36.630 --> 06:38.160
<b>Stop your nonsense!</b>

06:38.160 --> 06:41.310
<b>The Zhang Xiaohou I know would never 
abandon teammates or friends!</b>

06:50.180 --> 06:53.180
<b>Don't... look... back...</b>

06:55.840 --> 06:56.870
<b>Hang in there a bit longer.</b>

06:56.870 --> 06:58.020
<b>The sun's almost up!</b>

06:59.550 --> 07:02.350
<b>Xiaohou, I'm going to find you!</b>

07:02.350 --> 07:04.280
<b>I won't fall here!</b>

07:09.350 --> 07:11.700
<b>Stay here with me!</b>

07:11.700 --> 07:14.190
<b>We can still be a team this way!</b>

07:50.830 --> 07:53.240
<b>The sun's up! The sun's finally up!</b>

07:53.240 --> 07:55.140
<b>Thank the heavens!</b>

07:59.980 --> 08:01.230
<b>You guys are too strong!</b>

08:01.230 --> 08:04.080
<b>You guys actually held your own 
against a Sword-Axe Corpse General.</b>

08:04.080 --> 08:06.310
<b>Even high-tier mages might 
not be able to do that!</b>

08:07.180 --> 08:08.270
<b>It's daytime now.</b>

08:08.270 --> 08:09.550
<b>We should be safe.</b>

08:09.550 --> 08:11.810
<b>Let's push on and rest on the way.</b>

08:12.910 --> 08:14.070
<b>I'm not doing too bad.</b>

08:14.070 --> 08:16.850
<b>I can basically recover my mana in a day.</b>

08:17.350 --> 08:19.320
<b>How far are we from Hua Village?</b>

08:19.320 --> 08:21.220
<b>We should arrive before sunset.</b>

08:21.540 --> 08:23.720
<b>Good. Let's go now!</b>

08:25.630 --> 08:27.240
<b><i>Xiaohou, wait for me!</i></b>

08:27.240 --> 08:29.180
<b><i>I'm not abandoning you!</i></b>

08:53.520 --> 08:54.970
<b>Thank you, Fu Da!</b>

08:59.440 --> 09:03.130
<b>Those who live in the Weiju area grew up 
drinking god-granted Kun well water.</b>

09:03.130 --> 09:06.390
<b>It's why we can survive in this land 
that's ridden with undead.</b>

09:07.210 --> 09:09.110
<b>If you stay with us and drink 
this water for a few years,</b>

09:09.110 --> 09:10.470
<b>the undead will 
stop attacking you!</b>

09:17.940 --> 09:20.840
<b>Come to think of it, have you 
remembered who you are yet?</b>

09:23.010 --> 09:23.830
<b>Oh, well.</b>

09:23.830 --> 09:26.300
<b>If you really can't remember, 
you can just stay here.</b>

09:26.300 --> 09:27.840
<b>You're strong and hardworking.</b>

09:27.840 --> 09:29.370
<b>Everyone really likes you.</b>

09:29.960 --> 09:32.600
<b>Oh? My dad's the village chief.</b>

09:32.600 --> 09:35.080
<b>He's the one who decides 
if this guy can stay here.</b>

09:35.080 --> 09:38.640
<b>And nobody said they liked 
some scar-faced stranger!</b>

09:38.640 --> 09:40.970
<b>Xie Jun! Was I talking to you?</b>

09:42.550 --> 09:45.520
<b>You're just a girl, and you 
randomly took in a stranger.</b>

09:45.520 --> 09:48.220
<b>And a man, at that. Do you 
think that's appropriate?</b>

09:48.880 --> 09:50.470
<b>That's none of your business.</b>

09:51.290 --> 09:53.770
<b>Luo, you can't say that.</b>

09:54.110 --> 09:57.680
<b>Xie Jun is the only magician amongst the 
younger generation of this village.</b>

09:57.680 --> 09:59.870
<b>And he's a Beginner Tier Level 3 mage.</b>

09:59.870 --> 10:02.940
<b>That's quite amazing even 
outside of the village.</b>

10:02.940 --> 10:05.020
<b>He returned here to protect us,</b>

10:05.020 --> 10:08.330
<b>has our best interest at heart, after all.</b>

10:08.330 --> 10:09.850
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

10:10.400 --> 10:12.940
<b>While it's said the Weiju 
villages are protected by the well god,</b>

10:12.940 --> 10:15.620
<b>it's not like we can guarantee 
that accidents won't happen.</b>

10:15.620 --> 10:18.390
<b>Just think about our neighboring 
village, Yangyang Village...</b>

10:24.140 --> 10:25.300
<b>Chief!</b>

10:28.110 --> 10:30.970
<b>Luo, you know the rules in this village.</b>

10:30.970 --> 10:33.680
<b>This youth you saved 
is of unknown identity.</b>

10:33.680 --> 10:36.470
<b>Once his wounds are healed, 
it's best we send him on his way.</b>

10:37.530 --> 10:39.790
<b>But he doesn't even remember who he is!</b>

10:39.790 --> 10:41.850
<b>Don't you see that huge wound 
on the back of his head?</b>

10:42.400 --> 10:45.140
<b>Since when has our village 
become so cold and uncaring?</b>

10:45.680 --> 10:47.410
<b>Oh, but when times are tough...</b>

10:47.410 --> 10:48.470
<b>Chief, Chief!</b>

10:48.470 --> 10:50.640
<b>Old Yang was devoured by
undead while guarding the village.</b>

10:50.640 --> 10:51.920
<b>What?!</b>

10:51.920 --> 10:53.050
<b>It's the middle of the day!</b>

10:53.050 --> 10:54.490
<b>How are undead appearing?!</b>

10:54.490 --> 10:57.930
<b>They never attack those of us in Weiju!</b>

10:58.270 --> 10:59.560
<b>Everything I said is true!</b>

10:59.560 --> 11:00.860
<b>Go take a look!</b>

11:05.320 --> 11:06.620
<b>We'll go take a look, too!</b>

11:18.840 --> 11:19.900
<b>Chairman Han.</b>

11:19.900 --> 11:21.960
<b>Still no news from the oracle?</b>

11:22.890 --> 11:23.850
<b>Not yet.</b>

11:47.810 --> 11:49.930
<b>The celebration ceremony
 is about to begin.</b>

11:49.930 --> 11:51.640
<b>How are the preparations coming along?</b>

11:51.640 --> 11:53.290
<b>Everything is ready.</b>

11:53.290 --> 11:55.640
<b>But there is one small thing...</b>

11:56.010 --> 11:58.850
<b>If it's something small, 
then deal with it yourself.</b>

11:59.320 --> 12:01.030
<b>I still need to report to Master.</b>

12:01.030 --> 12:02.470
<b>I can't deal with everything.</b>

12:02.850 --> 12:07.880
<b>Yes, sir! Then I will
 eradicate the problem.</b>

12:13.040 --> 12:14.040
<b>This...</b>

12:14.040 --> 12:15.840
<b>Heavens, it really is eating him!</b>

12:15.840 --> 12:16.520
<b>This is terrifying!</b>

12:36.250 --> 12:37.210
<b>What's the matter?</b>

12:37.210 --> 12:39.520
<b>Did the old guard not 
drink the Kun well water?</b>

12:39.930 --> 12:40.920
<b>Of course he did!</b>

12:40.920 --> 12:43.620
<b>We'd forget to eat before 
we'd forget to drink the water!</b>

12:43.620 --> 12:47.350
<b>But... it still attacked us! 
And in broad daylight!</b>

12:48.360 --> 12:50.110
<b>It's a mutant undead!</b>

12:50.110 --> 12:52.720
<b>Karma! It's our karma!</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:56.470
<b>Oh, heavens, I'm going to die here!</b>

13:00.790 --> 13:01.440
<b>Run!</b>

13:01.440 --> 13:02.830
<b>Quickly! Run!</b>

13:08.720 --> 13:11.210
<b>Where's the chief? And Xie Jun?</b>

13:11.210 --> 13:12.850
<b>Weren't they headed this way?</b>

13:17.270 --> 13:17.770
<b>Hey!</b>

13:20.000 --> 13:20.520
<b>Run!</b>

13:22.620 --> 13:23.960
<b>There are a lot more outside!</b>

13:23.960 --> 13:26.120
<b>If they get into the 
village, it's all over!</b>

13:30.000 --> 13:31.470
<b>The gate can't stay open like this!</b>

13:37.930 --> 13:40.520
<b>Fu Da! Hang in there! 
I'm going to go close the gate!</b>

13:44.790 --> 13:46.930
<b>Sizzling Fire! Explosion!</b>

13:54.960 --> 13:56.060
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

13:56.920 --> 13:58.430
<b>Saving you guys!</b>

13:58.430 --> 14:00.720
<b>Can't you see that fool 
can't handle this at all?</b>

14:01.470 --> 14:03.180
<b>Then what about the gate?</b>

14:03.640 --> 14:04.930
<b>Don't mind the gate.</b>

14:04.930 --> 14:06.880
<b>This kind of gate won't hold them back.</b>

14:06.880 --> 14:08.690
<b>Xie Jun and I can handle 
this for a little longer.</b>

14:08.690 --> 14:11.590
<b>You go gather everyone and hide 
in the basement under the well!</b>

14:17.060 --> 14:18.430
<b>Fu Da! Let's go!</b>

14:22.960 --> 14:24.220
<b>Everyone, listen to me!</b>

14:24.220 --> 14:26.640
<b>Hide in the well! Go hide in the well!</b>

14:30.620 --> 14:31.390
<b>Hurry!</b>

14:31.390 --> 14:33.020
<b>Let women and children go down first!</b>

14:39.340 --> 14:40.380
<b>Here!</b>

14:41.200 --> 14:43.720
<b>Quickly! Let women and children go first!</b>

14:44.300 --> 14:45.440
<b>Things are already this bad!</b>

14:45.440 --> 14:47.900
<b>Who cares anymore?! Let me down first!</b>

14:47.900 --> 14:49.060
<b>Don't push!</b>

14:49.060 --> 14:50.680
<b>Why is he doing this?</b>

14:53.980 --> 14:55.560
<b>Undead are coming!</b>

14:56.820 --> 15:00.100
<b>It's over! We're all going to be eaten!</b>

15:02.910 --> 15:05.350
<b>Save us!</b>

15:06.090 --> 15:07.340
<b>Where are the chief and Xie Jun?</b>

15:07.340 --> 15:08.560
<b>They're not dead, are they?</b>

15:09.650 --> 15:10.870
<b>What are we going to do?</b>

15:10.870 --> 15:13.540
<b>They're the only ones in the
village who know magic!</b>

15:15.690 --> 15:17.140
<b>Let my kids go down first!</b>

15:17.140 --> 15:18.620
<b>Quickly!</b>

15:19.290 --> 15:22.720
<b>There are so many undead!</b>

15:32.150 --> 15:34.430
<b>Thunderbolt, Wild Dance!</b>

15:40.080 --> 15:41.770
<b>Look! Who's that?</b>

15:43.140 --> 15:44.900
<b>It's a mid-tier mage!</b>

15:44.900 --> 15:46.640
<b>He's way stronger than Xie Jun!</b>

15:52.140 --> 15:53.540
<b>They're here to save us!</b>

15:53.540 --> 15:54.720
<b>Yeah!</b>

15:57.690 --> 16:00.840
<b>Are you guys... hunters passing by?</b>

16:00.840 --> 16:02.520
<b>Thank you for helping 
us in the nick of time!</b>

16:06.160 --> 16:07.220
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

16:09.690 --> 16:11.340
<b>What is all this?</b>

16:11.340 --> 16:12.640
<b>Undead in the middle of the day?</b>

16:12.640 --> 16:13.560
<b>And this many of them?</b>

16:13.560 --> 16:17.000
<b>A curse! We've been cursed!</b>

16:17.000 --> 16:19.000
<b>We're going to end up like Yangyang Village.</b>

16:19.000 --> 16:21.060
<b>We're all going to die!</b>

16:25.550 --> 16:26.560
<b>Go hide, quickly!</b>

16:26.560 --> 16:28.020
<b>There are at least a hundred undead!</b>

16:34.900 --> 16:38.020
<b>Even we can't handle that many undead!</b>

16:39.250 --> 16:41.240
<b>The basement under the well 
is sealed with Kun well water.</b>

16:41.240 --> 16:42.680
<b>Undead shouldn't go there.</b>

16:43.470 --> 16:46.270
<b>Heroic visitors, please come with us!</b>

17:11.720 --> 17:14.720
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:14.720 --> 17:17.720
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:17.720 --> 17:20.720
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:20.720 --> 17:23.720
<b>Timer and Final QC: Henry Lin</b>

18:38.640 --> 19:08.790
<b>PREVIEW</b>

18:39.280 --> 18:41.020
<b>Xiaohou! Xiaohou!</b>

18:41.780 --> 18:42.680
<b>I don't know you.</b>

18:44.650 --> 18:47.020
<b>The well water... Why's it all gone?</b>

18:47.510 --> 18:49.560
<b>Impossible... That's impossible...</b>

18:50.030 --> 18:52.530
<b>How can they still be... alive?!</b>

18:56.420 --> 18:58.020
<b>What else are you hiding from us?!</b>

18:58.020 --> 18:59.810
<b>I can answer that.</b>

19:01.770 --> 19:04.220
<b>Everyone in Hua Village deserves to die!</b>
